                        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">🧪 <strong>7-Layer Molecular Sharding:</strong> Data is condensed like liquid through 7 hierarchical sequence layers (AST Blueprint ➔ Token Entropy ➔ Vector Keys ➔ Mass ➔ Topology ➔ Police Inspectors ➔ Merkle Root).</li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">🛡️ <strong>Unhackable Without Full Sequence:</strong> If a hacker steals raw Layer 4 chunks, they cannot decompress or read it without all other layer SHA-256 checkpoints matching.</li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">⚡ <strong>Phone-Number Prefix/Suffix Cache (O(1) &lt; 0.005 ms):</strong> Like matching a phone number with first 3 and last 4 digits, RAM index matches via an 8-character prefix/suffix key in nanoseconds!</li>
                        <li>🔒 <strong>Zero-Tamper Guarantee:</strong> Modifying even 1 bit in Layer 4 invalidates the Sovereign Merkle Root, instantly freezing the shard and denying access.</li>
                    </ul>
