                    <p style="font-size:13px; color:#94a3b8; margin-bottom:12px;">BPE token estimator & prompt context compressor engineered specifically for LLMs and autonomous AI agents.</p>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Prompt / Source Code Context</label>
                        <textarea id="tokenInput" rows="2" style="width:100%; background:#030712; border:1px solid #374151; color:#fff; border-radius:8px; padding:8px; font-family:monospace; font-size:12px;">In full-stack architectures, Node.js and Python require massive multi-file boilerplate, express middleware, npm modules, and excessive context window consumption.</textarea>
